{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9b8ca231-a507-4cb6-8876-9af3881df595",
    "name": "Tile Showroom Backend API",
    "description": "Full API for the Tile Showroom Visualization System \u2014 single admin login, 5 rooms x 5 layouts, tile catalogue with Elasticsearch search + Redis caching, room/layout/tile foreign-key based visualization flow, and PDF export.\n\nRun requests top-to-bottom within a folder to auto-capture ids (token, roomId, layoutId, tileId, visualizationId, adminId) into collection variables via each request's Tests script \u2014 later requests reference them automatically.\n\nBefore testing: run `npm run seed` on the backend to populate 5 rooms, 5 layouts each, and 1200 tiles, and set `baseUrl` below if not running on localhost:5000.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
